{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939950/extras/461465154825d9b7fe3403382a63bec8.poster.avif?t=1759416183\" width=804 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939950/extras/461465154825d9b7fe3403382a63bec8.webm?t=1759416183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ballisticards</strong> is a physics-based, point-chasing, deck-building roguelike. Drop balls onto your cards to rack up points. Use face cards to launch your balls to keep the action going. Power-up your deck with stickers, paint, and stamps to trigger wild chain reactions, discover powerful synergies, and score big!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each stage, lay out your cards and drop your ball, earning as many points as you can. Reach the target number of points to progress to the next stage, or fail and start over (no big deal!).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield a 52-card deck. Unlike other deck-builders, you do not add or remove cards from this deck. Instead, you modify the cards using paint and manually-placed stickers, allowing the creation of essentially infinite unique cards. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a collection of stamps with passive effects, to unlock powerful combinations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll have a ball!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939950/extras/3c43babc19972e9da62481dab00737b1.avif?t=1759416183\" width=128 height=128 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939950/extras/aba6bfd3569697774d82b9a6d288f000.avif?t=1759416183\" width=128 height=128 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939950/extras/fe74787f76d9180ccbaa42874ffc1cf4.avif?t=1759416183\" width=128 height=128 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple playable balls</strong>, with different physical properties and special abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn coins and buy upgrades</strong>. Use your strategy and skills to exceed the stage's goal and earn bonus coins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 100 card upgrades</strong>, in the form of paint and stickers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of stamps to provide <strong>powerful passive upgrades</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss stages</strong> that crank up the challenge level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple difficulty levels</strong> for these seeking a true challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3939950?t=1759416183","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939950/207daa2ed351c7a56c26587a7f67c7c15b5f72c6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759416183","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939950/a659bdad15959933b95ea622c76e1a5cc00e4723/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759416183","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939950/a659bdad15959933b95ea622c76e1a5cc00e4723/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759416183","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939950/extras/461465154825d9b7fe3403382a63bec8.poster.avif?t=1759416183\" width=804 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939950/extras/461465154825d9b7fe3403382a63bec8.webm?t=1759416183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ballisticards</strong> is a physics-based, point-chasing, deck-building roguelike. Drop balls onto your cards to rack up points. Use face cards to launch your balls to keep the action going. Power-up your deck with stickers, paint, and stamps to trigger wild chain reactions, discover powerful synergies, and score big!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each stage, lay out your cards and drop your ball, earning as many points as you can. Reach the target number of points to progress to the next stage, or fail and start over (no big deal!).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield a 52-card deck. Unlike other deck-builders, you do not add or remove cards from this deck. Instead, you modify the cards using paint and manually-placed stickers, allowing the creation of essentially infinite unique cards. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a collection of stamps with passive effects, to unlock powerful combinations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll have a ball!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939950/extras/3c43babc19972e9da62481dab00737b1.avif?t=1759416183\" width=128 height=128 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939950/extras/aba6bfd3569697774d82b9a6d288f000.avif?t=1759416183\" width=128 height=128 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939950/extras/fe74787f76d9180ccbaa42874ffc1cf4.avif?t=1759416183\" width=128 height=128 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple playable balls</strong>, with different physical properties and special abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn coins and buy upgrades</strong>. Use your strategy and skills to exceed the stage's goal and earn bonus coins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 100 card upgrades</strong>, in the form of paint and stickers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of stamps to provide <strong>powerful passive upgrades</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss stages</strong> that crank up the challenge level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple difficulty levels</strong> for these seeking a true challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more!</p></li></ul>","developers":["SuperYellows"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939950/b75642de003fc6707beb8dc8b789d5aa5005a893/header.jpg?t=1759416183","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3939950/1802199172/02ac2252d2ee001e945cb0a9a1a7395f67b0b185/1758409884/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758809520","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3939950/1802199172/02ac2252d2ee001e945cb0a9a1a7395f67b0b185/1758409884/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758809520","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3939950/1802199172/02a